    "Connected by design.": "为互联而设计。",
    "Three parts. A clear path through the FTI ecosystem.": "三个组成部分，清晰探索 FTI 生态。",
    "Your place in the network.": "您在网络中的位置。",
    "Explore membership and the binary network from your personal workspace. Review position, activity and eligibility in one place.": "在个人工作区探索会员与二叉网络，集中查看位置、活动和参与资格。",
