    "A shared responsibility.": "共同的责任。",
    "Understand the role of the council and the controls around protocol decisions. Review active proposals in the platform.": "了解委员会职责与协议决策约束，在平台查看当前提案。",
    "Council workspace": "委员会工作区",
    "02 / THE FTI TOKEN": "02 / FTI 代币",
    "Understand the flow.\nThen make your move.": "理解流程，\n再采取行动。",
    "FTI uses smart contracts to record token supply and reserve movements. Buying, selling and transferring are separate actions: review the quote, fees, recipient and network in your wallet before signing. The final outcome is determined by the active contract and the confirmed transaction receipt.": "FTI 智能合约记录代币供应与储备变化。买入、卖出和转账是独立操作：签名前请在钱包中核对报价、费用、收款方和网络。最终结果由当前合约和已确认交易回执决定。",
    "Transfer": "转账",
    "Reserve enters.\nFTI is minted.": "储备进入，\nFTI 铸造。",
