    "Connection unavailable. Reload this page to retry.": "连接不可用，请刷新页面重试。",
    "Skip to workspace": "跳转到工作区",
    "Explore the protocol ↗": "探索协议 ↗",
    "View transaction ↗": "查看交易 ↗",
    "Permanent emergency pro-rata redemption": "永久紧急按比例赎回",
    "Above-cap matched volume is flushed each hour; only the unmatched stronger-leg balance is saved when the capped points are fully funded. Within-cap volume deferred by the $20 funding floor remains. Flushed credit stays in the protected reserve.": "每小时清除超过上限的匹配业绩；当上限内积分获得足额资金时，仅保留较强分支未匹配的差额。因 20 美元资金底线而延后的上限内业绩仍保留，清除的额度留在受保护储备中。",
    "Hourly pool / eligible points · USD": "每小时资金池 / 合资格积分 · USD",
    "The entire hourly point pool is shared in proportion to eligible capped points. Above-cap matches flush; only unmatched stronger-leg volume remains. Only integer rounding carries to the next hour when points are eligible.": "整个每小时积分池按上限内合资格积分比例分配。超上限匹配会清除，仅未匹配差额保留。有合资格积分时，仅整数舍入余量结转至下一小时。",
    "Below $16, protection increases for the next hour; above $20 it eases one level. Protection changes rank point caps, never withholds eligible rewards. With no eligible points the pool carries forward.": "低于 16 美元时，下一小时保护提高一级；高于 20 美元时降低一级。保护调整等级积分上限，不扣留合资格奖励。无合资格积分时资金池结转。",
    "Each rank pool includes its previous monthly remainder. Eligible ranks share equally, with the existing 20% per-wallet limit and one payment per rank. Unpaid funds and rounding remain available for later months.": "各等级池包含上月余额。合资格等级平均分配，适用每钱包 20% 上限及每等级一次付款。未付资金和舍入余量留待后续月份使用。",
    "One inviter can share unlimited direct invitations. Your binary position is assigned automatically, level by level, left before right.": "推荐人可分享不限数量的直接邀请。您的二叉位置按层级、先左后右自动安排。",
    "Finding the next free position in the inviter’s network…": "正在推荐人网络中寻找下一个空位…",
    "Browser wallet": "浏览器钱包",
    "Choose an installed wallet, or use WalletConnect for QR and mobile wallets.": "选择已安装的钱包，或使用 WalletConnect 连接二维码和手机钱包。",
    "Choose an installed EVM wallet. On mobile, open this site inside your wallet browser. WalletConnect QR requires a project ID and is not configured yet.": "选择已安装的 EVM 钱包。手机上请在钱包内置浏览器打开网站。WalletConnect 二维码需项目 ID，目前尚未配置。",
    "No wallet detected. Install a wallet extension or use your wallet’s browser, then retry.": "未检测到钱包。请安装扩展或使用钱包内置浏览器，然后重试。",
    "WalletConnect could not start. Try again.": "WalletConnect 无法启动，请重试。",
