    "Enter a valid sponsor address.": "请输入有效推荐人地址。",
    "Placement suggestion failed integrity checks.": "安置建议未通过完整性检查。",
    "Enter a positive amount and slippage between 0% and 5%.": "请输入正数金额及 0%–5% 滑点。",
