    "Enter an amount within your unlocked token balance.": "请输入不超过可用代币余额的金额。",
    "Choose a different recipient wallet.": "请选择不同的收款钱包。",
    "The recipient must own at least one membership unit.": "收款方至少需持有一个会员单位。",
    "Events are unavailable.": "事件不可用。",
    "The scheduling proposal has not been executed.": "排程提案尚未执行。",
    "Contract data loaded. Connect a wallet to manage your account.": "合约数据已加载，请连接钱包管理账户。",
    "Connection unavailable: ": "连接不可用：",
    "Gross reserve value per FTI": "每枚 FTI 总储备价值",
    "Real-reserve pricing": "真实储备定价",
    "Pricing model": "定价模型",
    "Reserve / total shares": "储备 / 总份额",
    "Recorded test USD backing": "已记录的测试 USD 支持",
    "The 3% buy and sell fees remain in the real reserve. Positive trades and transfer burns increase the exact reserve/share value. There is no timed yield. The first paid allocation backs permanently locked shares; direct USD donations do not change quotes.": "3% 买卖费用留在真实储备中。正额交易与转账销毁提高储备/份额值。不存在按时间产生的收益。首次付费分配支持永久锁定份额，直接 USD 捐赠不改变报价。",
    "Redeem unlocked FTI against recorded reserves. A 3% fee stays in reserve; check the net quote. A rising gross price does not guarantee profit or the value of the collateral.": "用未锁定 FTI 赎回已记录储备。3% 费用留在储备中，请核对净报价。总价格上涨不保证利润或抵押资产价值。",
    "3% fee. Gross sales up to $500 and final full-supply exits are exempt from ordinary sale limits. Minimum output and deadline always apply.": "费用 3%。总额不超过 500 美元的卖出及最终全部供应退出豁免普通卖出限制。最低输出与截止时间始终适用。",
    "V3 tokens have no time or wallet-count locks. Pauses, emergency state and sale limits still apply.": "V3 无时间或钱包数量锁定，暂停、紧急状态及卖出限制仍然适用。",
    "Reserve / FTI": "储备 / FTI",
    "Reserve / supply · $0.10 first cycle, $0.20 restarts": "储备 / 供应 · 首周期 0.10 美元，重启 0.20 美元",
    "No premint or time locks. Ordinary trade fees stay in reserve. Support is used only on a price drop, with the minimum available injection. Final-exit fees and remaining support go to development. Each new cycle starts with a $0.20 bootstrap quote.": "无预铸或时间锁。普通交易费用留在储备中。仅在价格下跌时以可用的最小注入额提供支持。最终退出费用与剩余支持转给开发账户。新周期以 0.20 美元初始报价开始。",
    "Reserve/share quotes, 3% fee. Sales above $500 retain 5% single-sale and 20% hourly limits; final full-supply exit is exempt. Transfers burn 3%. Support may be exhausted and does not guarantee a price floor.": "储备/份额报价，费用 3%。超过 500 美元的卖出适用单笔 5% 与每小时 20% 限制，全部供应退出除外。转账销毁 3%。支持可能耗尽，不保证底价。",
    "The amount entered is your total debit: the recipient receives 97% and 3% is burned. The burn rounds up to the smallest FTI unit. Recipients do not need membership.": "输入金额为总扣款：收款方收到 97%，3% 被销毁，销毁量向上取整至最小 FTI 单位。收款方无需会员资格。",
    "Recipient receives: ": "收款方收到：",
